Comment “System” and I’ll send you the link to try out Claude.

@claudeai and specifically Claude Cowork has drastically changed the way I stay organized recently and I’ve been using it to not only accomplish more and stay on top of tasks, but also prioritize what actually moves the needle towards my goals.

And sometimes it even gets a lil sassy with me and tells me that am not doing something and that I need to do better 😂. Talk about an accountability partner #ClaudePartner
